            "heading": "2. Types of Data We May Collect",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We may collect and process the following categories of personal data:</p><ul><li><strong>Identification Data</strong>: Full name, title, date of birth</li><li><strong>Contact Information</strong>: Email address, phone number, billing and delivery addresses</li><li><strong>Transaction Data</strong>: Purchase history, payment details (processed securely via third parties)</li><li><strong>Preference Data</strong>: Wishlist items, marketing preferences</li><li><strong>Technical Data</strong>: IP address, browser type, device information, cookies, usage data</li></ul><p>We collect this data when you interact with our website, make a purchase, subscribe to our communications, or contact our customer service.</p>",
            "page": ""
