            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Some of our service providers may be located outside the UAE. In such cases, we ensure your data is transferred securely, in accordance with applicable data protection standards and contractual safeguards.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_aXDWaM": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. Data Retention",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Your data is retained for a limited duration, necessary for:</p><ul><li>Completing transactions</li><li>Complying with legal and tax obligations</li><li>Resolving disputes and enforcing our terms</li></ul><p>After this period, your data is securely erased or anonymized.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Ty7i68": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "7. Your Rights",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>In accordance with UAE data protection regulations, you may:</p><ul><li>Request access to your personal data</li><li>Rectify or update your data</li><li>Request erasure (subject to legal exceptions)</li><li>Object to marketing communications</li><li>Request data portability to another service provider</li></ul><p>You can exercise these rights by contacting us at <strong>Lausanne@lausanne.ae</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
