            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data, including:</p><ul><li>SSL encryption</li><li>Secure hosting infrastructure</li><li>Access restriction to authorized personnel only</li><li>Regular monitoring and threat assessments</li></ul><p>Despite these precautions, we encourage users to take steps to protect their online data.</p>",
